cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FDG PET SUVR and PETPVE12 partial-volume correction on OpenNeuro ds002898"
message: "Please cite this software using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Andrade Rey"
    given-names: "Rene"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5627-579X"
abstract: >-
  Completed quality-controlled single-subject research portfolio workflow
  using OpenNeuro ds002898. The repository documents dynamic FDG PET frame
  selection, MCFLIRT motion correction, static PET construction, SPM12
  segmentation and PET-T1 coregistration, PETPVE12 Muller-Gartner
  partial-volume correction, bilateral cerebellar-cortex SUVR, regional atlas
  summaries, and 4/5/6/8 mm PSF sensitivity analysis.
